  "caveats": [
    "eHYD's own download service enumerates the allowed data types server-side; owf_wassertemp_monatsmittel is the only surface-water temperature type.",
    "The bulk package contains WT-Monatsmittel only (324 files, no daily WT folder).",
    "Monthly rows are ~11.7 per station-year and all fall on one day of month, so they cannot be expanded into daily series without invention.",
    "qu_quellwassertemp is a DAILY temperature series but for spring water, not for a river waterbody, and it is therefore not eligible under protocol rule 2/3.",
    "The station listing marks several monthly candidates as lakes (e.g. Neusiedler See, Altausseer See); river-only filtering was not applied because no daily product exists to filter.",
    "No frozen-screen performance was computed on eHYD data (ingest + QC only)."
  ],
